Pro Tips for DevOps Engineers
Use IAM roles for service accounts to give fine-grained permissions to Pods.
Use EKS Managed Node Groups for simplified scaling and patching.
Enable cluster autoscaler and horizontal pod autoscaler (HPA) for elasticity.
Integrate Prometheus + Grafana for real-time metrics visualization.
Always encrypt secrets with KMS and use private subnets for worker nodes.
